    "summary": "All 35 episodes rebuilt from pakiet_PL v4.5 against the committed English reference set; nothing is carried over. 18 episodes changed against the v4.3 archive: (1) v4.5 renamed 24 mission titles to fit the mission-select bar, so 60 heading lines now print the new form; (2) the v4.4 story-language review corrected 22 dialogue rows, and where a corrected row belongs to a DLC variant the variant now matches the accepted base scene and is verified as an alias instead of printed twice (episodes 03 and 08 lose 15 redundant fragment lines - every removed line is present verbatim elsewhere in the same episode); (3) episode 34, which the previous delivery carried over from v4.3, still had the pre-v4.4 GoShogun line (`nie wyrzuciło` instead of `nie trafił`) twice - it is now corrected like the rest. Totals for all 35 episodes: 47,056/47,056 prose entries (100%), 32,977 unique + 14,079 aliases, 33,608 verified spans, 2,436,871 B of Markdown."
